  "scope": "Only this new MAP illustration folder plus the lane art document. No runtime, app, backend, shared, character or source-archive edits.",
  "source": "Ten null-bound MAP illustrations reuse each exact original era shrub_bed frame. Generation/crop/packing/runtime hashes are pinned per era. No source pixel/alpha edits or new PNG/font.",
  "native": "Three768x1296 MAP projects/PNGs; two original PNGs plus one exact font each. Removing ten added image layers preserves all93 original layers; all pixels outside ten rectangles equal v10.",
  "validation": "build.py0; verify.py0 all source/resource/native/bounds/depth/visibility checks; check.mjs0 for36sourcebrowsercases at360/390/430,216labelchecks and216added-decoration-foot samples; plan/archive and whitespace0.",
  "review": "Owner source/native/browser validation. No new independent visual critic panel or acceptance score; no blanket peer/release approval implied.",
  "publication": "Task branch only; Root153 is the designated frontend/art publisher. Sent handoff is not master publication proof. v10-publication.json proves only the previous v10 source publication.",
  "adoption": "Require exact ef52 geometry and era atlas hash. Stable depth-sort MAP illustrations with existing scenery; labels then real runtime markers. WORLD ignores the sidecar. No extra canonical revision beyond the actual ef52 binding itself; artist allocates no server revision. Old0448/map5 and all v9/v10 sources remain frozen.",
  "limits": "No application/Phaser/server/source-review/release/device/multiuser/physical acceptance. No new place/interaction/solid or selected state. Full reference fidelity and concrete consumer findings remain in the same active artist goal."
